Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part A}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.31,0:00:38.31,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Loudbone! Flare Song!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.77,0:00:44.77,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wanival! Aqua Cutter!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.47,0:01:11.13,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,That’s actually kinda hitting...{That's kinda unexpectedly-greatly...}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.14,0:01:13.43,Main,Dot Navi,0,0,0,,...the feels!{エモい！}
Comment: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:16.76,Main,,0,0,0,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:02:46.85,0:02:46.85,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part B}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.45,0:03:01.37,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Awesome as usual, Dot!{Sasuga. line} \N Such a pretty photo!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.37,0:03:03.87,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Maybe that’s the magic of \N the sunset at work...{Maybe that's the thing called 'sunset magic'. | As in 'huh, I've heard of that concept... That's what caused it to look good, nothing to do with me.'}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.29,0:03:06.04,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It just kinda hit the feels for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.04,0:03:07.88,Main,Roy Ult,0,0,0,,The feels?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.01,0:03:16.51,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Masquernya’s move just happened to \N add on to the others!{~~The Cat: You calling that a coincidence?~~}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.51,0:03:18.89,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I name it the Feels Special!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.89,0:03:21.18,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Who said {\i1}you{\i0} get to name it?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.18,0:03:24.02,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,It’s a good name. \N The Feels Special!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.02,0:03:25.89,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What’s this “feels” stuff?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.56,0:03:32.23,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Roy, you battled with Mr. Colza{Honorifics note: Colza-san} \N and Mr. Hassaku at Orange Academy, right?{Hassaku-sensei}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.65,0:03:34.74,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,I was thinking about that, too! {I had remembered the same thing!}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.74,0:03:37.78,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Fire and Ice moves \N collided with each other...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.08,0:03:45.33,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,...and everyone there was captivated. {And everyone watched amazed.}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.33,0:03:48.75,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I’d like it if more people \N got to see ours, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.75,0:03:50.59,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Then I’ve got a good idea!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.34,0:03:56.47,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,A Pokémon Contest! \N That could be great!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.47,0:03:58.76,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, \N that’s one way to do it! {Of course, so that method existed! (and I didn't think of it)}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.76,0:04:01.85,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,We can show {\i1}everyone{\i} \N the Feels Special!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.85,0:04:04.64,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What, they don’t even battle?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.64,0:04:10.10,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Huh... Cuteness, Beauty, Coolness... \N A tournament where you compete in those categories?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.15,0:04:14.40,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,We can work together \N and put on a lovely show.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.61,0:04:22.49,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Looks like they{Wanival-tachi} want to join in, too.{are interested in doing it too.}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.37,0:04:28.83,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,But ordinarily{ALT:customarily}, only one trainer \N gives commands to the Pokémon in a contest.{'That's the way it is'/that's the rule/regulation/custom that everyone follows/what's settled, but shouldn't step on later 'rules' lines, this is more just 'that's the way it is'}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.83,0:04:32.63,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,So the three pairs of us can’t enter?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.17,0:04:38.88,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,But without Loudbone, Wanival, and Masquernya \N all together, we can’t do the Feels Special!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.30,0:04:44.51,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Oh, it says that one representative \N can bring in other people’s Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.97,0:04:46.64,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Let’s do that, then!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.64,0:04:48.39,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.39,0:04:49.56,Main,Liko Roy Dot,0,0,0,,{\i1}...shoot!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.15,0:04:52.61,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Whoa{Oh/Ah}, I won... {...I was the winner.}{'I ended up winning', to my own surprise}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.61,0:04:55.11,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Then you’re our rep, Liko.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.11,0:04:58.57,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Loudbone, make sure \N you listen closely to what Liko says!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.66,0:05:02.16,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,You too, Wanival!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.16,0:05:06.29,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Here’s to being a team!{close-to-TL-ALT: Let’s be a good team!}{yoroshiku}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.29,0:05:10.25,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,And her stage costume?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.25,0:05:11.87,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Leave that to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.58,0:05:14.46,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Okay, you’re entered!{Okay, entry completed!}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.46,0:05:17.71,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,What, already?! \N I haven’t had time to take all this in...{I haven't had time to prepare my heart...}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.71,0:05:20.93,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. \N You’ve got a great coach at your side!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.93,0:05:22.30,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,A coach?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.30,0:05:25.47,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Leave it to Navi, dearie!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.47,0:05:26.68,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,“Dearie”?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.01,0:05:28.68,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What, you an expert?{What, are you knowledgeable [in the subject]?}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.35,0:05:31.69,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Saw a vid about it yesterday.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.69,0:05:33.44,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Only seen a vid?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.90,0:05:37.44,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Let’s show off what makes \N each of us special{shine}!{Let's show off everyone's individual good points!}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.44,0:05:39.61,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Let’s work together \N and do our best!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.96,0:06:00.84,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Now, hustle time, dearie!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.84,0:06:03.18,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Seriously, {\i1}what{\i0} is that character \N you’re playing?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.14,0:06:07.47,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Start the music!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.81,0:06:12.35,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Loudbone! \N Flare Song, please!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.98,0:06:19.23,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Listen to what Liko says!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.95,0:06:24.82,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wanival! Aqua Cutter!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.12,0:06:28.33,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.87,0:06:34.71,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Sorry, Masquernya. \N Just hold on a bit right now!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.71,0:06:36.71,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wanival, you fired those late!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.96,0:06:44.72,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop, dearie!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.22,0:06:48.72,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,The Feels Special \N isn’t coming together too well...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.18,0:06:53.31,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Giving commands to Pokémon that \N aren’t your partners is tough, eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.77,0:06:58.77,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Loudbone and Wanival aren’t used to \N working together with Liko, either...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.73,0:07:03.11,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Coach. Got any good ideas?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.11,0:07:05.86,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Well, if you put me on the spot...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.86,0:07:09.24,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,When you’re lost, \N watch a vid, dearie!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.24,0:07:10.74,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Coach...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.12,0:07:12.33,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,A vid...?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.91,0:07:14.00,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,That’s it!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.37,0:07:22.21,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,When Loudbone fires his Flare Song, \N you add your Aqua Cutter to it, Wanival.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.21,0:07:25.63,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,That’ll make it so when they collide, \N it’ll spread out beautifully.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.41,0:07:49.62,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Loudbone! Flare Song!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.87,0:07:52.95,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wanival! Aqua Cutter!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.33,0:07:56.16,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Masquernya! Magical Leaf!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.38,0:08:04.05,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.09,0:08:11.68,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Masquernya...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.44,0:08:21.73,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,{Oh... }Sorry! I’m not mad!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.65,0:08:24.69,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,How about we take a little break?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.53,0:08:27.19,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Sorry, Masquernya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.78,0:08:30.11,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,But let’s give practice our all!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.74,0:08:34.79,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,One more try after the break!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.47,0:08:57.60,Main,Person,0,0,0,,That’s cool!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.53,0:09:10.03,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,What a crowd.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.03,0:09:13.37,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And they’re all here \N for the Pokémon Contest, aren’t they?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.37,0:09:16.08,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Going in person is just \N {\i1}extra{\i0} good, y’know?{Because seeing [something] in-person is a one-level-of-taste different, after all.}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.08,0:09:17.75,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Somethin’ smells good!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.75,0:09:19.33,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Let’s go, Yamirami!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.79,0:09:24.88,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,{\q2}Well, Ult’s being led by his appetite... \N So how about we kick back and enjoy ourselves, too? {We have people like Ult who runs around guided by his appetite; so let's [follow his example] and enjoy this comfortably!}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.67,0:09:27.25,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Sounds like the right idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.76,0:09:34.39,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,We got the Feels Special all sharpened up \N and looking real good, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.76,0:09:35.89,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You’re right.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.27,0:09:45.02,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Okay, let’s go!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.48,0:09:51.40,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Those Pikachu{tachi} must be contestants, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.40,0:09:54.20,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,They’re the famous Cutie Pikapika!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.20,0:09:56.24,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Apparently they’re contest regulars.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.37,0:10:02.37,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Their costumes are really detailed, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.37,0:10:06.04,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,They’ve got their routine down to a tee, \N and they’re all so cute!{Their movements are precise, and they're all cute!}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.88,0:10:09.76,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Let’s hurry up and go, dearie!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.26,0:10:12.22,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh...? Hey, wait for me!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.13,0:10:55.13,Main,Audience,0,0,0,,{\i1}So cute!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.68,0:11:01.89,Main,Yuzuko,0,0,0,,Not bad, dearie, but what I seek is \N an unprecedented, exciting performance.{Yuzuko: Lots of posh long English words. Navi only copies the zamasu, not the posh vocab.}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.27,0:11:07.15,Main,Yuzuko,0,0,0,,{\q2}You’ve still quite a ways to go before you might \N perhaps impress my esteemed Bunyatto{Honorifics note: Bunyatto-san} and me, dearie.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.57,0:11:12.65,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,The real live Yuzuko’s here!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.65,0:11:15.40,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,She’s just like the vids, dearie!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.40,0:11:17.66,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,So it was her rubbing off on you.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.28,0:11:24.91,Main,Snow J. Powder,0,0,0,,Tyltalis! \N Sing, followed by Cotton Guard!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.71,0:11:34.88,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Why, it’s practically snowing!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.88,0:11:37.13,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,What a fantastical atmosphere!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.05,0:11:41.51,Main,Snow J. Powder,0,0,0,,Amamaiko! Fawn!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.32,0:11:55.28,Main,Snow J. Powder,0,0,0,,Rokon! Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.37,0:12:06.66,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,The snowscape suddenly \N turns into a shining starry sky!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.66,0:12:09.71,Main,Snow J. Powder,0,0,0,,Finish it up! Triple Axel!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.72,0:12:28.31,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,A performance interweaving \N fire and fluff!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.31,0:12:31.44,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,The Coolness, the Beauty, the Cuteness!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.44,0:12:33.98,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,I expect high scores in each category!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.40,0:12:36.57,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,That was Mr. Snow J. Powder{Honorifics note: Snow J. Powder-san}, folks!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.36,0:12:38.95,Main,Snow J. Powder,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone!{crowd: suteki! He's so lovely!}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.41,0:12:48.96,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That was incredible... Beautiful...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.33,0:12:52.79,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Who knew Pokémon moves \N could manage performances like that?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.46,0:12:56.84,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Tyltalis’s song was so nice!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.30,0:12:59.22,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Gave me an airy feeling in my heart...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.59,0:13:03.72,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And I... have to get up \N on the same stage they did, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.26,0:13:05.31,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Liko?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.76,0:13:08.64,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I just... suddenly got all worried.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.60,0:13:11.98,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,So Liko gets worried too...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.98,0:13:13.73,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh? I mean...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.73,0:13:19.86,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You’re level-headed and reliable, so I thought \N you were the kinda person who could do anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.36,0:13:22.24,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Definitely not.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.24,0:13:24.74,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Then thank goodness Navi’s here!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.74,0:13:25.62,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.62,0:13:28.87,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,‘Cause nothing scares Navi!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.87,0:13:31.46,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,The two of us’d be \N the strongest duo around, right?{If the two of us team up, wouldn't we be the Strongest?[same as Ultphrase]}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.00,0:13:33.25,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Navi...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.25,0:13:36.21,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. \N I know you can do it, Liko!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.21,0:13:38.59,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,You’ve practiced so much, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.59,0:13:44.72,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,And Loudbone{tachi} and the others \N will do all they can to help!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.85,0:13:52.73,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Here’s your costume for today.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.73,0:13:54.19,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.86,0:13:56.48,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I’ll try my best!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.86,0:14:01.61,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,If anyone goes badmouthing Liko, \N I’ll get Ult to knock ‘em out!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.61,0:14:03.57,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Not happenin’.{Can’t go doing that.}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.62,0:14:05.41,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.41,0:14:07.95,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Ult said something sensible for once...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.41,0:14:12.79,Main,Organizer,0,0,0,,Ms. Liko{Honorifics note: Liko-san}, please be ready \N and standing by!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.79,0:14:14.08,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.38,0:14:18.21,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Let’s all make this \N into one incredible show!
Comment: 0,0:14:24.47,0:14:24.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part C}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.22,0:14:35.48,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,The next team to participate will be \N Meow-Meow-Liko-Liko and Her Friends!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.56,0:14:37.98,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Dot...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.36,0:14:41.99,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon, over here.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.36,0:14:44.45,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Let’s go!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.05,0:15:07.18,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Loudbone! Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.18,0:15:16.90,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\q2}Such intensity! \N Loudbone’s fire basks the stage in blazing color!{Loudbone's fire is hotly dyeing the stage!}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.35,0:15:19.27,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wanival! Wave Tackle!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.20,0:15:26.61,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Air Cutter!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.58,0:15:30.58,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,How beautiful!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.58,0:15:35.71,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Combo moves from Loudbone and Wanival \N create a fantasy realm of fire, water, and wind!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.46,0:15:40.21,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You’re both doing incredible!{ii kanji}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.21,0:15:41.80,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Good work, Wanival!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.80,0:15:43.38,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Not a hitch so far!{~~Now you've gone and said it.~~}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.38,0:15:44.09,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Next up...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.09,0:15:46.34,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Masquernya! Trick Flower!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.22,0:15:48.89,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?! Where are you going?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.89,0:15:52.47,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,What’s this?! \N An unexpected exit from Masquernya?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.47,0:15:53.97,Main,Yuzuko,0,0,0,,Oho...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.89,0:15:58.52,Main,Yuzuko,0,0,0,,Did you spot that, \N my esteemed Bunyatto{Honorifics note: Bunyatto-san}?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.52,0:16:00.90,Main,Yuzuko,0,0,0,,That was no mere accident.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.90,0:16:05.86,Main,Yuzuko,0,0,0,,The jealousy and fussiness \N of the Pokémon known as Masquernya...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.86,0:16:08.70,Main,Yuzuko,0,0,0,,She is making a deliberate \N display of them!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.58,0:16:14.49,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Loudbone! \N A Flare Song melody, please!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.12,0:16:18.00,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wanival! \N A big dance and Aqua Cutter!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.50,0:16:24.88,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Give it all you’ve got, Loudbone!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.88,0:16:28.38,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wanival! Show them \N your signature dance moves! {Wanival, show them the dance steps which are your forte/strong point!}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.38,0:16:30.59,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Masquernya?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.26,0:16:37.27,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\q2}With Masquernya’s exit, the performance continues \N with only Loudbone and Wanival!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.01,0:17:13.22,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon’s so cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.22,0:17:19.60,Main,Yuzuko,0,0,0,,{\q2}Bravo. An exhibition of Masquernya’s conscience, \N having divested herself of her jealous side...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.60,0:17:21.60,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,I-Is {\i1}that{\i0} what that was?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.48,0:17:28.78,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Of course... \N The way you moved back then...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.78,0:17:30.28,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You weren’t just playing around.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.28,0:17:33.57,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Metamon wanted to join in \N on the Feels Special too, didn’t it?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.79,0:17:42.96,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I’m sorry I took so long to realize!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.42,0:17:45.92,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Let’s push this show to its peak!{Let’s make this into the greatest show!}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.25,0:17:47.84,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You too, Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.92,0:17:55.35,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,A-Astoundingly, a Metamon makes \N an unregistered appearance! This is unheard of!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.35,0:17:57.31,Main,Yuzuko,0,0,0,,Exceedingly interesting, dearie.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.31,0:17:57.93,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.93,0:18:01.06,Main,Yuzuko,0,0,0,,A surprise that betrays expectations.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.06,0:18:03.94,Main,Yuzuko,0,0,0,,Now {\i1}that{\i0} is the true appeal \N of a live performance!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.92,0:18:31.97,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,How beautiful! A carnival comprised \N of fire and water, of flowers and smiles!{How beautiful! Fire and water, flowers and smiles come together in a carnival!}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.47,0:18:40.06,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Err... After careful review...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.06,0:18:45.52,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Team “Meow-Meow-Liko-Liko and Her Friends” \N is disqualified for a breach of regulations.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.52,0:18:47.31,Main,Audience,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.31,0:18:51.07,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,She {\i1}did{\i0} use a Pokémon \N that hadn’t been entered, after all...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.07,0:18:53.32,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,But it was cute so who cares?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.32,0:18:55.49,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,It was one incredible show!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.70,0:19:00.58,Main,Yuzuko,0,0,0,,Rules are rules, dearies.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.24,0:19:05.46,Main,Yuzuko,0,0,0,,However... \N It shook my heart, dearies.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.46,0:19:09.75,Main,Yuzuko,0,0,0,,The purity of passion in its desire \N to take the stage alongside its friends...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.34,0:19:14.59,Main,Yuzuko,0,0,0,,And the impromptu teamwork \N they reciprocated with...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.59,0:19:16.34,Main,Yuzuko,0,0,0,,Bravo, dearies.{Bunyatto: Bravo, bravo.}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.55,0:19:24.48,Main,Yuzuko,0,0,0,,As such... We will award you \N the Judge’s Special Prize, dearies.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.98,0:19:25.73,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.35,0:19:28.86,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Did we even have a prize like that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.23,0:19:31.86,Main,Yuzuko,0,0,0,,We do now, dearie.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.57,0:19:38.16,Main,Yuzuko,0,0,0,,Congrats, dearie.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.16,0:19:40.12,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.20,0:19:42.99,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.41,0:19:44.62,Main,Roy Dot,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.58,0:19:47.62,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Congrats, dearie.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.97,0:19:59.51,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Ahh! That was so much fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.51,0:20:02.64,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Mmm, and I got to eat a ton of tasty stuff!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.64,0:20:05.23,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Contest stalls ain’t nothin’ to scoff at!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.69,0:20:09.60,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Sheesh, you haven’t stopped eating \N since we got here, Ult!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.60,0:20:14.15,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Anyway, Liko’s show is the important thing! \N And it hit the feels like crazy!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.28,0:20:17.36,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Though it ended up full of surprises.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.36,0:20:20.82,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Yeah. That’s why it hit so many feels.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.82,0:20:22.74,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Still don’t get it.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.29,0:20:29.50,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,{\q2}It wasn’t a show that’ll go down in the record books, \N but it’ll stick in peoples’ memories, don’t you think?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.13,0:20:35.55,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Thanks to Navi’s coaching, dearie!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.34,0:20:38.97,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You’re right about that. \N Thanks, Navi.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.84,0:20:42.64,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And thanks for the cute costume, Dot!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.64,0:20:46.89,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I got to take plenty more good photos. \N I had a great time, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.31,0:20:51.69,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon! Aren’t you glad \N Masquernya invited you on stage?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.73,0:20:58.53,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And you, Masquernya... Thanks for all the effort \N you put in to make it a lovely show!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.53,0:21:04.03,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wanival, you really \N glitzed it up again today!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.29,0:21:11.37,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Your song echoed across that huge stage! \N Your singing was so cool, Loudbone!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.34,0:21:17.55,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,{\q2}Thanks to all your help, \N it turned out to be one incredible Pokémon Contest!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.01,0:21:24.85,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Events always leave you feeling accomplished, \N but a little sad they’re over, don’t they?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.85,0:21:25.60,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Yeah...{ Ah.}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.48,0:21:35.02,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,The night’s first star!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.02,0:21:36.53,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Now that...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.90,0:21:38.24,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}...hits the feels!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.24,0:21:40.57,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I keep tellin’ ya \N I still don’t get it!
Comment: 0,0:21:45.49,0:21:45.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie A}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.83,0:21:48.04,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Friede here!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.54,0:21:51.92,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It’s time to Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.00,0:21:55.04,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Today’s topic is Pikachu!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.04,0:21:57.38,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,A famous face \N who needs no introduction.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.38,0:22:02.13,Main,Friede,0,0,25,,So then, do you know where you should look \N to tell males and females apart?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.30,0:22:06.47,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,See the answer after the commercials!
Comment: 0,0:22:06.47,0:22:06.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{Ending}
Comment: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:36.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie B}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.36,0:23:42.32,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Time to announce \N the correct answer!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.32,0:23:43.86,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,The answer is...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:43.86,0:23:45.74,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,A: Their tails!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.74,0:23:49.53,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Unlike males, the tails of females \N are heart-shaped.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:55.04,0:23:55.96,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:55.96,0:23:59.96,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,That reminds me, when Pikachu gather, \N electricity builds up, and thunder—
Comment: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:01.00,0:24:03.71,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Hey, Liko, have you heard of \N the Mototokage Race?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:03.71,0:24:06.88,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Every year, they race a full lap \N around Paldea! It’s awesome!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:06.88,0:24:08.97,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,And everyone rides a Mototokage?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:08.97,0:24:12.89,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Yeah! The teams put these \N flashy outfits on them, so it’s fun to watch!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:12.89,0:24:14.64,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Sorta like those?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:14.64,0:24:15.89,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Yeah, exactly!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:15.89,0:24:18.81,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,That Mototokage looks strong; \N it even has a crest!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:18.81,0:24:20.69,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And that one’s cool too! \N It’s glowing!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:20.69,0:24:24.44,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And so, to be continued \N next time on Pocket Monsters!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:24.44,0:24:27.95,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Koraidon & Miraidon! The Great Paldea Race!!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:27.95,0:24:30.45,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Are those really Mototokage...?
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,
