Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.03,0:22:21.49,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Gonna give my motivation button a little tap!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.49,0:22:22.74,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}The power of hard work is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.74,0:22:23.24,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}(Ahem!)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.24,0:22:24.74,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}But if I slack off I might end up devolving...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.74,0:22:25.70,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Well, that’s no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.70,0:22:26.62,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}But now you mention it...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.62,0:22:29.95,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}I know button mashing won’t help at all
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.95,0:22:32.46,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}So stop shaking this maiden’s heart already
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.46,0:22:33.21,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}(Stop it!)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.21,0:22:36.21,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Getting attached, but then they turn away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.21,0:22:39.46,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}When things just don’t go the way that you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.46,0:22:42.84,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Isn’t it so fun? Doesn’t it make your heart race?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.84,0:22:45.97,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Doesn’t it make you all excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.97,0:22:47.68,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}When I feel a spark...
